 to which you are devoted?\"","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":52,"sd":null},{"k":"21:53","t":"They said, \"We found our fathers worshippers of them.\"","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":53,"sd":null},{"k":"21:54","t":"He said, \"You were certainly, you and your fathers, in manifest error.\"","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":54,"sd":null},{"k":"21:55","t":"They said, \"Have you come to us with truth, or are you of those who jest?\"","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":55,"sd":null},{"k":"21:56","t":"He said, \"[No], rather, your Lord is the Lord of the heavens and the earth who created them, and I, to that, am of those who testify.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":56,"sd":null},{"k":"21:57","t":"And [I swear] by Allāh, I will surely plan against your idols after you have turned and gone away.\"","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":57,"sd":null}],"juz":17,"hizb":33,"surahs":[21],"sajdah":false}